/Title (Children start school knowing thousands of words by ear, just not how they are written. LIFTeracy builds on this. The AI tutor asks the child, by voice on WhatsApp, to read a word; speech-to-text finds any letter they got wrong, and the tutor gives a picture hint. Teachers share the link with students to use at home, and follow progress on dashboards.)
